# Create Helper Rule

Helper classes go under `packages/cursor_edu_core/lib/src/helper/`.

## Structure

- PascalCase + Helper: `StorageHelper`, `GameStateHelper`
- Stateless or singleton
- Platform check: `kIsWeb`, `Platform.isX` before platform-specific code

## Example

```dart
class StorageHelper {
  StorageHelper._();
  static final StorageHelper instance = StorageHelper._();

  Future<void> setString(String key, String value) async { ... }
  String? getString(String key) { ... }
}
```
